WEBVTT

q0001
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.975
What has to happen before two differently written subexpressions can share one node?

q0002
00:00:07.975 --> 00:00:18.704
This episode has one job: Normalization chooses a stable structure, structural keys identify it, and interning reuses the matching node; these stages cooperate but are not synonyms.

q0003
